<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="818316"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1613486312"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ツキアカリのミチシルベ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ステレオポニー"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ツキアカリのミチシルベ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:56.800"><div begin="00:00.687" end="03:48.209"><p begin="00:00.687" end="00:07.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.687" end="00:01.733">答えの</span><span begin="00:01.733" end="00:01.903">な</span><span begin="00:01.903" end="00:02.346">い</span><span begin="00:02.346" end="00:03.046">毎</span><span begin="00:03.046" end="00:03.447">日</span><span begin="00:03.447" end="00:04.112">が</span> <span begin="00:04.112" end="00:04.634">ただ</span><span begin="00:04.634" end="00:05.372">過ぎて</span><span begin="00:05.372" end="00:05.484">ゆ</span><span begin="00:05.484" end="00:06.065">く</span><span begin="00:06.065" end="00:07.192">時間</span><span begin="00:07.192" end="00:07.933">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找不到答案的日子</span></p><p begin="00:08.033" end="00:12.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:08.033" end="00:09.004">これから</span><span begin="00:09.004" end="00:09.677">先</span><span begin="00:09.677" end="00:10.405">どう</span><span begin="00:10.405" end="00:10.856">なる</span><span begin="00:10.856" end="00:11.279">の</span><span begin="00:11.279" end="00:11.688">だ</span><span begin="00:11.688" end="00:12.445">ろう？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此后该何去何从？</span></p><p begin="00:12.645" end="00:15.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:12.645" end="00:12.860">わ</span><span begin="00:12.860" end="00:13.698">か</span><span begin="00:13.698" end="00:14.700">ら</span><span begin="00:14.700" end="00:15.283">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无从知晓</span></p><p begin="00:15.311" end="00:22.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:15.311" end="00:15.871">闇</span><span begin="00:15.871" end="00:16.500">よりも</span><span begin="00:16.500" end="00:17.433">深</span><span begin="00:17.433" end="00:17.641">い</span><span begin="00:17.641" end="00:18.161">夜</span><span begin="00:18.161" end="00:18.821">の</span><span begin="00:18.855" end="00:19.764">孤独に</span><span begin="00:19.764" end="00:20.599">惑わ</span><span begin="00:20.599" end="00:21.199">さ</span><span begin="00:21.199" end="00:21.560">れ</span><span begin="00:21.560" end="00:22.725">ていた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这比黑暗还要深重的夜的孤独</span></p><p begin="00:22.725" end="00:27.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:22.725" end="00:23.683">だれかに</span><span begin="00:23.683" end="00:24.285">今</span><span begin="00:24.285" end="00:25.225">気づい</span><span begin="00:25.225" end="00:25.421">て</span><span begin="00:25.421" end="00:26.335">欲し</span><span begin="00:26.335" end="00:27.276">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻想要有人注意到自己</span></p><p begin="00:27.493" end="00:35.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:27.493" end="00:29.348">ここ</span><span begin="00:29.348" end="00:30.269">か</span><span begin="00:30.269" end="00:30.691">ら</span><span begin="00:30.691" end="00:31.234">逃</span><span begin="00:31.234" end="00:32.145">げ</span><span begin="00:32.145" end="00:33.063">出</span><span begin="00:33.063" end="00:33.627">し</span><span begin="00:33.994" end="00:34.348">たい</span><span begin="00:34.348" end="00:34.885">か</span><span begin="00:34.885" end="00:35.816">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想逃离这里</span></p><p begin="00:37.493" end="00:40.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:37.493" end="00:38.141">窓から</span><span begin="00:38.141" end="00:38.559">見え</span><span begin="00:38.559" end="00:38.797">る</span><span begin="00:38.797" end="00:39.368">朝</span><span begin="00:39.368" end="00:39.710">焼</span><span begin="00:39.710" end="00:40.659">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝霞透过窗户照进来</span></p><p begin="00:41.161" end="00:47.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:41.161" end="00:41.604">部屋に</span><span begin="00:41.604" end="00:42.705">鳴り響く</span><span begin="00:42.705" end="00:44.259">音</span> <span begin="00:44.899" end="00:45.866">アラームに</span><span begin="00:45.866" end="00:46.804">起こさ</span><span begin="00:46.804" end="00:47.699">れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音在房间里回荡</span></p><p begin="00:47.795" end="00:52.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:47.795" end="00:48.876">薄暗い</span><span begin="00:48.876" end="00:49.521">中</span> <span begin="00:49.709" end="00:49.984">家</span><span begin="00:49.984" end="00:50.978">飛び出す</span><span begin="00:50.978" end="00:52.059">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在昏暗中冲出家门</span></p><p begin="00:52.244" end="00:55.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:52.244" end="00:52.752">カバンの</span><span begin="00:52.752" end="00:53.176">中</span><span begin="00:53.176" end="00:53.450">に</span><span begin="00:53.450" end="00:54.022">は</span> <span begin="00:54.061" end="00:54.436">何も</span><span begin="00:54.436" end="00:55.014">変わら</span><span begin="00:55.014" end="00:55.877">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">背包里面</span></p><p begin="00:55.877" end="01:04.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:55.877" end="00:56.780">平凡</span><span begin="00:56.780" end="00:57.329">詰め</span><span begin="00:57.329" end="00:58.005">込ん</span><span begin="00:58.005" end="00:59.153">で</span> <span begin="00:59.777" end="01:00.570">そして</span><span begin="01:00.570" end="01:01.625">いつも</span><span begin="01:01.625" end="01:01.930">の</span><span begin="01:01.930" end="01:02.728">場所</span><span begin="01:02.728" end="01:04.693">へ</span></p><p begin="01:05.280" end="01:12.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:05.280" end="01:06.295">だれかが</span><span begin="01:06.295" end="01:06.906">言っ</span><span begin="01:06.906" end="01:07.354">た</span><span begin="01:07.354" end="01:08.121">言葉</span><span begin="01:08.121" end="01:08.683">が</span><span begin="01:08.783" end="01:09.164">気に</span><span begin="01:09.164" end="01:09.890">なって</span><span begin="01:09.890" end="01:10.945">惑わ</span><span begin="01:10.945" end="01:11.381">さ</span><span begin="01:11.381" end="01:11.783">れ</span><span begin="01:11.783" end="01:12.599">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在意他人的话</span></p><p begin="01:12.599" end="01:20.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:12.599" end="01:13.852">争いた</span><span begin="01:13.852" end="01:14.239">く</span><span begin="01:14.239" end="01:15.131">なんて</span><span begin="01:15.131" end="01:15.813">ない</span><span begin="01:15.813" end="01:16.259">か</span><span begin="01:16.259" end="01:17.295">ら</span> <span begin="01:17.466" end="01:19.283">何</span><span begin="01:19.283" end="01:19.761">も</span><span begin="01:19.972" end="01:20.929">言えない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想跟谁争论</span></p><p begin="01:20.929" end="01:24.569" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:20.929" end="01:21.573">夢</span><span begin="01:21.573" end="01:21.999">や</span><span begin="01:21.999" end="01:22.812">理想</span><span begin="01:22.812" end="01:23.222">は</span><span begin="01:23.402" end="01:23.860">ある</span><span begin="01:23.860" end="01:24.295">けれ</span><span begin="01:24.295" end="01:24.569">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然怀揣梦和理想</span></p><p begin="01:24.569" end="01:28.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:24.569" end="01:25.280">気持</span><span begin="01:25.280" end="01:25.703">ち</span><span begin="01:25.703" end="01:26.148">ば</span><span begin="01:26.148" end="01:26.421">か</span><span begin="01:26.421" end="01:27.087">り</span><span begin="01:27.262" end="01:27.924">先に</span><span begin="01:27.924" end="01:28.474">行</span><span begin="01:28.474" end="01:28.914">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却空有一腔热情</span></p><p begin="01:28.937" end="01:35.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:28.937" end="01:30.476">現実が</span><span begin="01:30.476" end="01:30.908">ずっ</span><span begin="01:30.908" end="01:31.983">と</span><span begin="01:32.079" end="01:33.938">後</span><span begin="01:33.938" end="01:34.475">ろ</span><span begin="01:34.841" end="01:35.397">か</span><span begin="01:35.397" end="01:35.738">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩现实在身后</span></p><p begin="01:35.762" end="01:40.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:35.762" end="01:37.541">ボク</span><span begin="01:37.541" end="01:38.159">を</span><span begin="01:38.439" end="01:38.973">見</span><span begin="01:38.973" end="01:39.448">て</span><span begin="01:39.448" end="01:40.489">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冷冷地看着我</span></p><p begin="01:42.658" end="01:48.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:42.658" end="01:42.939">ねぇ</span><span begin="01:42.939" end="01:43.814">誰か</span><span begin="01:43.814" end="01:44.763">教え</span><span begin="01:44.763" end="01:45.614">て</span> <span begin="01:46.271" end="01:46.688">みんな</span><span begin="01:46.688" end="01:47.262">そう</span><span begin="01:47.262" end="01:47.694">なの</span><span begin="01:47.694" end="01:47.998">か</span><span begin="01:47.998" end="01:48.825">な？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有没有人能告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:49.904" end="01:56.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:49.904" end="01:50.578">今日が</span><span begin="01:50.578" end="01:51.789">幸せ</span><span begin="01:51.789" end="01:52.084">な</span><span begin="01:52.084" end="01:52.645">ら</span> <span begin="01:52.877" end="01:53.717">それで</span><span begin="01:53.717" end="01:54.121">いい</span><span begin="01:54.121" end="01:54.590">と</span><span begin="01:54.822" end="01:55.651">思える</span><span begin="01:55.651" end="01:55.911">っ</span><span begin="01:55.911" end="01:56.922">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果今天感到幸福</span></p><p begin="01:57.242" end="02:04.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:57.242" end="01:58.241">幼い頃</span><span begin="01:58.241" end="01:59.011">には</span><span begin="01:59.119" end="01:59.656">確かに</span><span begin="01:59.656" end="02:00.332">あった</span><span begin="02:00.332" end="02:00.743">よ</span> <span begin="02:00.951" end="02:01.730">夢を</span><span begin="02:01.730" end="02:02.019">追</span><span begin="02:02.019" end="02:03.055">いかけてい</span><span begin="02:03.055" end="02:04.225">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">年幼时</span></p><p begin="02:04.745" end="02:09.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:04.745" end="02:05.335">でも</span><span begin="02:05.335" end="02:05.957">それも</span><span begin="02:05.957" end="02:06.905">遠い</span><span begin="02:06.905" end="02:07.410">記</span><span begin="02:07.410" end="02:09.693">憶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可那也不过是遥远的记忆</span></p><p begin="02:10.318" end="02:17.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:10.318" end="02:11.364">答えの</span><span begin="02:11.364" end="02:11.534">な</span><span begin="02:11.534" end="02:11.977">い</span><span begin="02:11.977" end="02:12.677">毎</span><span begin="02:12.677" end="02:13.078">日</span><span begin="02:13.078" end="02:13.743">が</span> <span begin="02:13.743" end="02:14.265">ただ</span><span begin="02:14.265" end="02:15.003">過ぎて</span><span begin="02:15.003" end="02:15.115">ゆ</span><span begin="02:15.115" end="02:15.696">く</span><span begin="02:15.696" end="02:16.823">時間</span><span begin="02:16.823" end="02:17.564">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找不到答案的日子</span></p><p begin="02:17.722" end="02:22.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:17.722" end="02:18.693">これから</span><span begin="02:18.693" end="02:19.366">先</span><span begin="02:19.366" end="02:20.094">どう</span><span begin="02:20.094" end="02:20.545">なる</span><span begin="02:20.545" end="02:20.968">の</span><span begin="02:20.968" end="02:21.377">だ</span><span begin="02:21.377" end="02:22.134">ろう？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此后该何去何从？</span></p><p begin="02:22.226" end="02:24.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:22.226" end="02:22.441">わ</span><span begin="02:22.441" end="02:23.279">か</span><span begin="02:23.279" end="02:24.281">ら</span><span begin="02:24.281" end="02:24.864">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无从知晓</span></p><p begin="02:24.993" end="02:28.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:24.993" end="02:25.557">ツキ</span><span begin="02:25.557" end="02:26.124">アカリ</span><span begin="02:26.124" end="02:26.614">の</span><span begin="02:26.614" end="02:27.062">ミ</span><span begin="02:27.062" end="02:27.312">チ</span><span begin="02:27.312" end="02:27.838">シル</span><span begin="02:27.838" end="02:28.302">ベ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月光的指引</span></p><p begin="02:28.402" end="02:32.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:28.402" end="02:29.093">雲を</span><span begin="02:29.093" end="02:29.655">超え</span><span begin="02:29.655" end="02:30.341">ボク</span><span begin="02:30.341" end="02:30.730">に</span><span begin="02:30.730" end="02:31.429">届</span><span begin="02:31.429" end="02:32.161">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过云端传递给我</span></p><p begin="02:32.261" end="02:37.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:32.261" end="02:33.009">進む</span><span begin="02:33.009" end="02:33.530">べき</span><span begin="02:33.530" end="02:34.292">道</span><span begin="02:34.292" end="02:34.622">を</span><span begin="02:34.622" end="02:35.561">照らし</span><span begin="02:35.561" end="02:35.992">て</span><span begin="02:35.992" end="02:37.004">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请照亮我该走的路</span></p><p begin="02:37.104" end="02:45.774" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:37.104" end="02:38.934">今日</span><span begin="02:38.934" end="02:39.671">が</span><span begin="02:39.889" end="02:40.900">どんな</span><span begin="02:40.900" end="02:41.733">に</span><span begin="02:41.774" end="02:43.221">壊れ</span><span begin="02:43.521" end="02:44.040">そう</span><span begin="02:44.040" end="02:44.511">で</span><span begin="02:44.511" end="02:45.774">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论今天怎样不堪</span></p><p begin="02:46.020" end="02:53.325" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:46.020" end="02:47.052">何が</span><span begin="02:47.052" end="02:47.903">あって</span><span begin="02:47.903" end="02:49.495">も</span> <span begin="02:49.743" end="02:50.764">何が</span><span begin="02:50.764" end="02:51.539">あって</span><span begin="02:51.539" end="02:53.325">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论发生什么</span></p><p begin="02:53.325" end="03:00.724" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:53.325" end="02:54.187">信じて</span><span begin="02:54.187" end="02:54.759">いたい</span><span begin="02:54.759" end="02:55.283">か</span><span begin="02:55.283" end="02:56.599">ら</span> <span begin="02:57.764" end="02:58.557">あの</span><span begin="02:58.557" end="02:59.082">日</span><span begin="02:59.082" end="03:00.724">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都愿意去相信</span></p><p begin="03:00.724" end="03:05.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:00.724" end="03:01.602">遠い</span><span begin="03:01.602" end="03:03.622">記憶</span> <span begin="03:03.949" end="03:04.433">呼び</span><span begin="03:04.433" end="03:05.086">覚ます</span><span begin="03:05.086" end="03:05.844">から</span></p><p begin="03:05.844" end="03:12.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:05.844" end="03:06.476">忘れ</span><span begin="03:06.476" end="03:06.951">ない</span><span begin="03:06.951" end="03:07.515">でね</span> <span begin="03:07.604" end="03:08.226">胸に</span><span begin="03:08.226" end="03:09.092">刻</span><span begin="03:09.092" end="03:09.442">み</span><span begin="03:09.442" end="03:10.001">つ</span><span begin="03:10.001" end="03:12.121">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会忘记，铭刻于心</span></p><p begin="03:12.667" end="03:15.959" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:12.667" end="03:13.552">答えは</span><span begin="03:13.552" end="03:14.586">自分</span><span begin="03:14.586" end="03:14.966">の</span><span begin="03:14.966" end="03:15.442">中</span><span begin="03:15.442" end="03:15.959">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答案一定就在</span></p><p begin="03:16.059" end="03:22.045" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:16.059" end="03:17.143">必ず</span><span begin="03:17.143" end="03:17.421">ある</span><span begin="03:17.421" end="03:17.900">も</span><span begin="03:17.900" end="03:18.453">の</span><span begin="03:18.453" end="03:18.854">だ</span><span begin="03:18.854" end="03:19.036">か</span><span begin="03:19.036" end="03:19.622">ら</span> <span begin="03:19.980" end="03:21.009">あきらめ</span><span begin="03:21.009" end="03:21.344">な</span><span begin="03:21.344" end="03:21.565">い</span><span begin="03:21.565" end="03:22.045">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己心中</span></p><p begin="03:22.045" end="03:28.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:22.045" end="03:22.732">強く</span><span begin="03:22.732" end="03:23.702">生き</span><span begin="03:23.702" end="03:24.492">る</span><span begin="03:24.728" end="03:25.660">こ</span><span begin="03:25.660" end="03:26.610">と</span><span begin="03:26.610" end="03:26.951">を</span><span begin="03:27.293" end="03:28.390">やめないで</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要放弃坚强过活的信念</span></p><p begin="03:28.390" end="03:34.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:28.390" end="03:29.302">悲</span><span begin="03:29.302" end="03:29.561">し</span><span begin="03:29.561" end="03:30.100">すぎ</span><span begin="03:30.100" end="03:30.653">て</span><span begin="03:30.751" end="03:31.375">前に</span><span begin="03:31.375" end="03:32.129">進め</span><span begin="03:32.129" end="03:32.786">ない</span><span begin="03:32.786" end="03:33.454">時</span><span begin="03:33.454" end="03:33.692">で</span><span begin="03:33.692" end="03:34.485">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算太过悲伤</span></p><p begin="03:34.692" end="03:48.209" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:34.692" end="03:35.239">共に</span><span begin="03:35.239" end="03:36.382">悩み</span><span begin="03:36.382" end="03:37.101">歩んだ</span><span begin="03:37.101" end="03:38.203">ぼくら</span><span begin="03:38.203" end="03:39.119">に</span><span begin="03:39.394" end="03:41.232">風</span><span begin="03:41.232" end="03:42.144">は</span><span begin="03:42.240" end="03:43.128">吹く</span><span begin="03:43.128" end="03:43.920">ど</span><span begin="03:43.920" end="03:44.924">こ</span><span begin="03:44.924" end="03:45.442">ま</span><span begin="03:45.822" end="03:46.846">でで</span><span begin="03:46.846" end="03:48.209">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们分担烦恼携手前行</span></p></div></body></tt>